  "material_note": "Rock rather than timber. The sheet is roughly half planks and half rubble and the planks are the larger half of the picture, but not of the model - the shaft is the well and the roof is a lid on it. One sheet is one material on the tiled path, so the question is which surface carries the object, not which fills the square.",
